WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.604 --> 00:00:16.010
A while later, the parade stopped.

2
00:00:18.011 --> 00:00:21.453
"Let's stay in here," whispered Mandy.

3
00:00:22.993 --> 00:00:23.814
Vinnie nodded.

4
00:00:24.354 --> 00:00:28.296
The children hid behind the silk curtain and peeked outside.

5
00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:32.070
They were stopped in front of a large open gate.

6
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.792
The same symbol of two birds was mounted above the gate.

7
00:00:38.013 --> 00:00:40.254
They heard someone walk up to their box.

8
00:00:40.274 --> 00:00:43.816
"Uh-oh," whispered Vinnie.

9
00:00:45.117 --> 00:00:49.419
Between the curtains he saw a long skirt and a huge sword.

10
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.021
A man stuck his face through the curtains.

11
00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:55.863
"Come out," he ordered.

12
00:00:57.044 --> 00:01:01.147
Outside, the children noticed the man was only about seventeen.

13
00:01:02.448 --> 00:01:04.870
His hair was pulled back and tied up.

14
00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:08.853
People carrying bundles stared at the children.

15
00:01:08.873 --> 00:01:10.575
"Who are you?"

16
00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:12.256
the young man asked.

17
00:01:13.377 --> 00:01:15.379
The children introduced themselves.

18
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:21.224
At that moment, an older man in a dark purple kimono appeared.

19
00:01:22.685 --> 00:01:25.928
People bowed to him and backed away respectfully.

20
00:01:27.252 --> 00:01:28.754
"What is the trouble, Haruki?"

21
00:01:29.314 --> 00:01:30.415
the man called out.

22
00:01:30.435 --> 00:01:35.139
"Daimyo Masamune," Haruki said, bowing deeply.

23
00:01:35.159 --> 00:01:39.063
"These children were riding in one of your palanquins."

24
00:01:40.484 --> 00:01:43.306
Daimyo Masamune stared at the children.

25
00:01:44.668 --> 00:01:46.209
Vinnie and Mandy gasped.

26
00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.491
He had only one eye!

27
00:01:48.511 --> 00:01:51.354
"Is your father a missionary?"

28
00:01:51.814 --> 00:01:52.395
he asked.

29
00:01:52.415 --> 00:01:53.736
"A Dutch trader?"

30
00:01:55.184 --> 00:01:58.325
Vinnie and Mandy were too scared to say anything.

31
00:01:58.345 --> 00:02:01.006
"You're afraid of me, aren't you?"

32
00:02:03.486 --> 00:02:05.787
He touched his missing eye and laughed.

33
00:02:05.807 --> 00:02:10.729
"But it's clear, you have traveled to Sendai on one of my palanquins.

34
00:02:11.889 --> 00:02:12.709
No one saw you.

35
00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:13.949
No one stopped you.

36
00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.970
You have courage, like a samurai."

37
00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:19.491
"A samurai?"

38
00:02:19.891 --> 00:02:21.192
Vinnie finally spoke.

39
00:02:21.212 --> 00:02:29.155
"Cool!" Daimyo Masamune said to Haruki, "You will look after them until I return.

40
00:02:30.396 --> 00:02:32.557
I must pay a visit to Shogun Ieyasu."

41
00:02:33.917 --> 00:02:36.979
Then he added, "Do not let them leave my castle."

42
00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:44.583
"Come this way," said Haruki to the children, leading them through the gate.

43
00:02:44.603 --> 00:02:47.305
"Are you a samurai?"

44
00:02:47.765 --> 00:02:49.146
asked Vinnie excitedly.

45
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:53.428
"I am being trained as a samurai," Haruki replied.

46
00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.321
"What is a daimyo?"

47
00:02:56.861 --> 00:02:57.642
asked Mandy.

48
00:02:57.662 --> 00:03:01.083
"A daimyo is the master of the samurai.

49
00:03:02.224 --> 00:03:04.766
Each daimyo is given a district by the shogun.

50
00:03:05.826 --> 00:03:08.968
The samurai living in that district serve the daimyo."

51
00:03:10.689 --> 00:03:13.690
Then Mandy asked, "What is a shogun?"

52
00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:19.333
"The shogun is what you Europeans call a general," explained Haruki.

53
00:03:20.514 --> 00:03:23.676
Vinnie and Mandy walked along a high stone wall.

54
00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:29.444
The castle was huge with many houses and courtyards of different sizes.

55
00:03:31.465 --> 00:03:36.008
Haruki climbed two low steps that led into the first house.

56
00:03:37.189 --> 00:03:38.890
Vinnie and Mandy did the same.

57
00:03:40.091 --> 00:03:42.813
Sliding doors separated the different rooms.

58
00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:47.056
Vinnie peeked inside one of the rooms as they passed.

59
00:03:48.376 --> 00:03:51.198
"Hey!" he shouted, staying behind.

60
00:03:51.218 --> 00:03:53.340
"What is it?"

61
00:03:53.828 --> 00:03:54.609
asked Mandy.

62
00:03:54.629 --> 00:03:56.953
"It's a dragon!"

63
00:03:57.533 --> 00:03:59.916
Vinnie cried, pointing into the room.

64
00:04:01.278 --> 00:04:02.900
Mandy's eyes grew big.

65
00:04:04.142 --> 00:04:08.308
A large frightening creature stood there wearing a suit of armor.
